<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><style>
@page{size:A4;margin:22mm}body{font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#20252d;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.55}.head{text-align:center;border-bottom:3px double {{ accent }};padding-bottom:14px}.head h1{color:{{ accent }};font-size:24px;margin:0}.warning{border:1px solid #d97706;background:#fff8eb;padding:10px;margin:16px 0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9px}.parties{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin:20px 0}.party{background:#f5f7fa;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding:13px}h2{color:{{ accent }};font-size:13px;margin-top:18px}.terms{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.term{border-bottom:1px solid #d0d5dd;padding:8px}.term strong{display:block;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#667085}.clause{break-inside:avoid}.signatures{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:45px;margin-top:35px}.signature{height:85px;border-top:1px solid #667085;padding-top:8px}
</style></head><body><header class="head"><h1>CONTRAT DE TRAVAIL</h1><p>{{ type_contrat }} · prise d'effet {{ date_debut }}</p></header><div class="warning"><strong>Modèle de référence :</strong> à adapter et faire valider selon le droit, la convention collective et la juridiction applicables.</div><section class="parties"><div class="party"><strong>EMPLOYEUR</strong><p>{{ employeur.name }}<br>{{ employeur.address }}<br>{{ employeur.city }}<br>SIRET : {{ employeur.siret }}</p></div><div class="party"><strong>SALARIÉ</strong><p>{{ salarie.name }}<br>{{ salarie.address }}<br>{{ salarie.city }}<br>Né(e) le {{ salarie.birth_date }}</p></div></section><p>Il est convenu ce qui suit :</p><section class="terms"><div class="term"><strong>Fonction</strong>{{ poste }}</div><div class="term"><strong>Lieu de travail</strong>{{ lieu_travail }}</div><div class="term"><strong>Rémunération</strong>{{ remuneration }}</div><div class="term"><strong>Temps de travail</strong>{{ temps_travail }}</div><div class="term"><strong>Période d'essai</strong>{{ periode_essai }}</div><div class="term"><strong>Convention / droit applicable</strong>{{ convention }}</div></section>{% for clause in clauses %}{% set prefix = (loop.index|string) ~ '. ' %}<section class="clause"><h2>{{ loop.index }}. {% if clause.title[:prefix|length] == prefix %}{{ clause.title[prefix|length:] }}{% else %}{{ clause.title }}{% endif %}</h2><p>{{ clause.content }}</p></section>{% endfor %}<section class="signatures"><div class="signature">Pour l'employeur<br>Nom, qualité, date et signature</div><div class="signature">Le salarié<br>Date, signature précédée de la mention requise</div></section></body></html>
